+## 0.9.25 - 2026-10-22
+
+- Enforce reviewed female identity eligibility and title/basename association at
+  the shared scene Tag write boundary, including learned repairs.
+- Preserve all existing Tags; reject removals, unknown identities, conflicting
+  aliases and unsupported gender evidence. Stop automatic Character Tag creation
+  and native Needs Review marker assignment/removal.
+- Add read-only `identity_eligibility_v1`; preserve Character taxonomy and
+  descriptor API meanings. See `IDENTITY-POLICY.md` for registry coverage and limits.
+- Use embedded-engine-compatible normalization, verified against installed Stash.
+
